    "ComponentObject": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "物件场景里的一个待生成物件。\n\n只描述\"做几个、多大、怎么摆\"，不描述几何——几何由构件生成节点按 KB 契约产出。\n没有 `parentWall` 之类的宿主字段：这类构件本就无宿主（见 KB《家具参数契约》）。\n\n`kind` 是**表达通道**，取值见 `generation.objects.subtypes.OBJECT_COMPONENT_KINDS`：\n\n- ``furniture`` —— 图鉴预设：`subtype` 取 `FURNITURE_SUBTYPES` 的 key，引擎有\n  逐子类型的原生 builder，几何最精确；\n- ``primitive`` —— 通用几何组合：形状由 `parts` 给出（每项一份 primitive 参数，\n  坐标是相对**物件底面中心**的局部坐标）。这是**开放集出口**：任何名字\n  （小人、花瓶、路灯、机器人）都从这里产出；\n- ``body`` —— 引擎的简化人物元素：形状参数在 `params`（KB《构件参数》§十）。\n\n`name` 是用户点名的原始名词，保留它是为了两件事：去重键里区分同通道的不同物件\n（\"花瓶\"和\"路灯\"都是 `primitive` 且都没有 subtype），以及让生成节点写出可读的 id。",
      "properties": {
        "count": {
          "default": 1,
          "maximum": 64,
          "minimum": 1,
          "title": "Count",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "depth": {
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 50,
          "title": "Depth",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "height": {
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 50,
          "title": "Height",
          "type": "number"
        },
        "kind": {
          "maxLength": 60,
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Kind",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "material": {
          "default": "",
          "maxLength": 80,
          "title": "Material",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "name": {
          "default": "",
          "maxLength": 60,
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "params": {
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "title": "Params",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "parts": {
          "items": {
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "type": "object"
          },
          "maxItems": 64,
          "title": "Parts",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "placement": {
          "default": "",
          "maxLength": 300,
          "title": "Placement",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "rationale": {
          "default": "",
          "maxLength": 300,
          "title": "Rationale",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "subtype": {
          "default": "",
          "maxLength": 60,
          "title": "Subtype",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "width": {
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 50,
          "title": "Width",
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "width",
        "depth",
        "height"
      ],
      "title": "ComponentObject",
      "type": "object"
    },
